Subject: [PATCH 28/68] feat(02-02): create action extraction module with
 instructor + Gemini Flash

- Define ExtractedAction and ActionExtractionResult Pydantic models
- extract_actions() uses instructor.from_genai() with Gemini Flash primary path
- Fallback to raw Gemini JSON mode + manual Pydantic validation on instructor failure
- Graceful error handling: always returns ActionExtractionResult, never raises
- Add instructor>=1.0.0 to requirements.txt
